<title>UK: Council of Europe sets $100 mln bond due Dec 1998.</title>
<headline>Council of Europe sets $100 mln bond due Dec 1998.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Nikko.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COUNCIL OF EUROPE</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     6.0 PCT   MATURITY    08.DEC.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE   *06.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 B.P.   LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	* SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AAA   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> NOTES	LAUCHED OFF DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
